#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0236 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "Mirror-asymmetry pin against PMDA-AD0235-valid_no_tr01ag1n_column-ADSL.cdt: byte-for-byte the same fixture shape, the opposite verdict. TRxxAGy matches TR01AG1 so the template expands (xx=01, y=1) and Requirements.Variables.All rewrites to ['TR01AG1N'], which is absent -> reported not executed with the Requirements.Variables reason. Here TR01AG1N is the TARGET (and the All entry); on AD0235 it is the KEY (and not the All entry)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TR01AG1 type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | POOLA
S1 | 002 | POOLA
S1 | 003 | POOLAA
